{
  "info": {
    "name": "paccradle API: billing in /me and design unlocks (2026-10-30)",
    "description": "Change: M1-D8 (2026-10-30). The client contract moves to **1.0.0-beta.7** (`api-version`); the admin contract stays at 1.0.0-beta.2 (the back office's `/me` is unchanged). Merge into the main contract.\n\n**Added:** `billing` on the client's `GET /me` (plan, credits, subscription, unlocked designs), and `unlock` on designs (`GET`/`PATCH /designs/{design_id}` and the `GET /designs` items). No new codes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:7773"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "design_id",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
