    {
      "name": "Client: billing (/api/client/v1)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Me, with billing",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/client/v1/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "v1",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The signed-in user (a guest too). The account's fields are unchanged; **new**: `billing`.\n\n- `plan`: `free`, `pro` or `studio`, from a live subscription (`trialing`, `active`, or `past_due` while Paddle still collects).\n- `credits`: export credits left (never expire).\n- `subscription`: the one that matters (a live one, else the latest), or `null`.\n- `unlocked_designs`: how many designs are unlocked. Each design says itself whether it is (`unlock` on `GET /designs/{design_id}` and in \"My designs\").\n\nAfter a pack purchase, poll this until `credits` grows; after Pro, until `plan` is `pro` (the webhook updates them, M1-F4)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 a new account",
