                "v1",
                "designs",
                "{{design_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**New:** `unlock` (also in `PATCH` answers and \"My designs\" items): `null` until the design's production files are paid for; then `source` (`purchase`, `credit`, `pro`), `edits_until` (versions saved until then export without paying again) and `covers_current_version` (whether the design as it is now exports its production files at no cost). After a single-export checkout, poll this design until `unlock` shows, then ask for the files."
          },
